    "version": "1.1.4",
    "title": "GitHub v3 REST API",
    "description": "A subset of GitHub's REST API description (github/rest-api-description, descriptions/api.github.com/api.github.com.json): the label and milestone endpoints of a repository, with every component they reference. GitHub's v3 REST API.",
